<title>CROATIA: Croatian Aug output falls 1.2 pct, up 9.3 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatian Aug output falls 1.2 pct, up 9.3 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     AUGUST	 JULY	 AUG '95</p>
<p> Monthly change pct		 -1.2	  -1.0	  -3.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year change		+9.3	  +6.4	  -1.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)		  99.9	 101.1	  91.4</p>
<p>NOTES -- January-August output rise was put at 2.3 percent compared to a year ago period. Data include estimates for Croatian territory held by separatist Serbs. Production in this area amounted to two percent of the total before 1991.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
